Hence, the coordinates of the tangency point on the ellipse must be 
\[x = \sqrt{6}\cos (135^\circ),\]and 
\[y = \sqrt{\frac{6}{5}}\sin (135^\circ).\]It follows that the desired answer is
\[r =  \boxed{\frac{1}{\sqrt 5}}.\]

